{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106312","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106312","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610631201:1":{"text":"왜 그래요? 그래서 그 사람 이름이 뭔데요?","source_cn":"怎么回事？他的名字怎么了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9879F7F83736DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610631202:1":{"text":"마... 말이 안 나와요! 그 사람 이름이... 윽! 그 이름을 말하려고 하니까... 입이 안 떨어져요...!","source_cn":"我……我说不出来！他的名字……呜！一提到就讲不出话……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89905D10FD62169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610631203:1":{"text":"여기 펜으로 종이에 쓸 수 있겠어요?","source_cn":"桌子上有纸笔，你试试写出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4EDBE7E9EE3C85B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610631204:1":{"text":"...그, 그것도 안 돼요... 이름을 쓰려고 하니까... 손이 안 움직여요.","source_cn":"……也……也不行，我的手……写到他的名字时就会动不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52E639A7CFB7EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610631205:1":{"text":"특별한 <style=\"highlight\">비밀 유지 마법</style>이군요. 두르엘라 님, 라이세움의 교장 대리로서 이 문제를 해결해 주시겠나요?","source_cn":"看来是种特殊的<style=highlight>守秘魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCA78274F5D83C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610631206:1":{"text":"흠, 워낙 특수한 마법이라 바로 풀기는 어렵습니다... 교수님들과 한번 상의를 해봐야 할 것 같네요.","source_cn":"咳，这种魔法很特别，不是一时半刻能够解决的……我需要和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD483AFB4E6E95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610631207:1":{"text":"그럼 비밀 유지 마법을 푸는 건 라이세움 측에 맡기겠습니다.","source_cn":"那么解开守秘魔法限制这件事就拜托你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9036E078A695B411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610631208:1":{"text":"니엘, 학교에 이런 계약을 맺은 학생이 얼마나 더 있는지 알고 있나요? 알고 있는 다른 계약자들이 있으면 알려주세요.","source_cn":"尼尔，你知不知道学校里有多少学生签订过这个契约？认不认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB465F41B9F18DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610631209:1":{"text":"“마력을 늘려주는 계약”에 대한 소문을 아는 학생들은 많아요. 아마 저 말고도 꽤 많이 계약을 맺었을 거고요. 정확히 누군지는 저도 모르지만요...","source_cn":"有不少学生都私下听说过“能增加魔力的契约”这件事……或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19E60E7E6EA6CE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610631210:1":{"text":"이 일을 공공연하게 말하는 사람은 없어요. 학교 규칙에 어긋나는 일이고, 마법사 윤리에도 맞지 않으니까요... 어차피 말하지 않으면 아무도 모를 일이기도 하고요...","source_cn":"没有人会到处宣扬这件事的，谁都知道这违反了学校规定，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBCE9366895020D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610631211:1":{"text":"마력 계약에 대해서는 어디서 들었죠? 어떻게 맺게 되었나요?","source_cn":"你从哪里知道这个魔力契约，又是怎样签约的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5327DA21D80B438","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610631212:1":{"text":"그게... 그... 말이 안 나와요!","source_cn":"在……呜！我……我说不出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A1A20C540B72E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610631213:1":{"text":"계약을 맺은 사람이 학생이나 교직원 같은 내부인인가요?","source_cn":"和你签订契约的是学校的人，某个学生或者教职工？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04FA362AB7B54CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610631214:1":{"text":"내부인은 아니에요. 학교에 들어온 적은 없는... 윽...","source_cn":"不是学校里的人。他从来不进学校……呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F4E20FB5E2A40D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610631215:1":{"text":"외부인이라고 확신하시는군요. 라이세움 학생들이 자주 가는 곳이라면 홀트 앨리일 테니... 거기서 계약을 맺었나요?","source_cn":"看来你很确定他是校外人士。除了莱希拉姆内，学生最常去的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCFE16F938CAA1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610631216:1":{"text":"윽... 으윽...","source_cn":"呜……呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x780E1C1128BD5C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610631217:1":{"text":"말이 안 나오는 거 보니 맞나 보네요. 홀트 앨리의 한 가게이었을까요?","source_cn":"说不出来？看来就是了，是这里的某家商店？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F24E3D8A5D0A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610631218:1":{"text":"그건... 으... 인기가 많은... 으윽!","source_cn":"是……呜……很喜欢的……呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653B7088B0B93DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1610631219:1":{"text":"학생들에게 인기가 많은 가게? 흠... 그런 가게를 찾으면 되겠네요. 혹시 특별한 암호나 절차가 있나요?","source_cn":"一家学生都很喜欢的店？嗯……是只要找到这家店就可以，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2411C8DA38E430EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1610631220:1":{"text":"으윽...","source_cn":"呜……<key:dialog63>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x762441F7E5563BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1610631221:1":{"text":"특별한 암호가 있는 모양이네요. 알겠습니다... 두르엘라 님, 니엘을 데리고 나가주세요.","source_cn":"看来有特殊暗号。我明白了……杜瑞拉女士，麻烦你带他离开吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x371178B62F6D2596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼尔":{"text":"니엘","source":"尼尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:杜瑞拉":{"text":"두르엘라","source":"杜瑞拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":3}}